sequenceDiagram
    User ->> Client (GUI): Initiates action (e.g., send message)
    Client (GUI) ->> Client (Network): Encapsulates data for transmission
    Client (Network) ->> Server: Sends request via TCP/IP
    Server ->> Messaging Subsystem: Routes message to appropriate subsystem
    Messaging Subsystem ->> User Database: Updates message history if needed
    Messaging Subsystem ->> Recipient Client: Delivers message
    Recipient Client ->> Client (GUI): Displays message
    Note right of Server: Handles group distribution and notifications